title: Letterbox
text: Only one slot in the wall, and two letters to post. Sort them again on the other side.
trick: merge red and blue in a splitter to squeeze both through one slot, then split the magenta and filter it back into red and blue
motif: fence with one slot
expect: merges>=1, recolours>=2
